WEBVTT

00:02.110 --> 00:07.360
I wish I could sleep with a girl
instead of patrolling pointlessly.

00:07.360 --> 00:09.740
I could use a rabbit girl.

00:10.160 --> 00:12.920
You really are into them, eh?

00:12.920 --> 00:16.590
They taste the best, after all.

00:16.590 --> 00:18.750
They also have the best moans.

00:19.600 --> 00:21.200
Hey, did you hear that?

00:22.250 --> 00:23.270
What's wrong?

00:34.210 --> 00:36.090
Sorry, must be the wind.

00:38.880 --> 00:41.200
Hey. Where'd you go?

01:09.080 --> 01:12.970
HQ, this is Alpha.
We've secured Point C.

01:13.450 --> 01:16.470
Beginning infiltration of the castle.

01:18.020 --> 01:25.360
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

02:47.020 --> 02:52.030
THE EMPIRE VS THE STRONGEST RABBITS

02:57.050 --> 02:59.170
HQ, this is Bravo.

02:59.170 --> 03:02.150
Finished spraying
sleeping medicine on all barracks.

03:02.930 --> 03:05.170
HQ, this is Charlie.

03:05.170 --> 03:09.540
Two princes, two Imperial grandchildren
and two Imperial princesses secured.

03:09.540 --> 03:13.800
Wow, so there's a place
like this in the world!

03:13.800 --> 03:16.170
I can't imagine having this in the forest!

03:16.170 --> 03:18.300
The food here is also first-class.

03:18.590 --> 03:21.770
It would be a waste not to enjoy it
while we have the chance.

03:25.350 --> 03:28.310
Aren't we attracting a lot of attention?

03:29.360 --> 03:31.490
The Empire's food is something else!

03:31.490 --> 03:34.070
This cake is the best!

03:39.410 --> 03:41.330
What's up with that gown?

03:48.330 --> 03:51.190
Sir Baius looks strange...

04:17.650 --> 04:20.640
Well, it's just so not like her.

04:20.640 --> 04:24.560
She wouldn't usually act in a way that'd
let people know what's on her mind.

04:24.560 --> 04:26.650
Well, that stuff happened.

04:26.650 --> 04:29.650
I bet the princess
has a lot on her mind.

04:29.650 --> 04:30.950
That stuff?

04:30.950 --> 04:33.750
Nagumo, what did you do to Lily?

04:33.750 --> 04:36.910
Hey, what do you mean by that, Yaegashi?

04:37.290 --> 04:41.560
If there's anything unreasonable happening,
it's mostly your fault, right?

04:41.560 --> 04:43.070
That hurts.

04:43.070 --> 04:46.300
I just happened to pass by
and save her when I saw her

04:46.300 --> 04:48.210
almost get assaulted by the crown prince.

04:48.210 --> 04:50.210
Oh, so she was assaulted...

04:50.210 --> 04:51.410
Say what?!

04:51.410 --> 04:54.270
What did you just say, Hajime?!

04:55.360 --> 04:56.760
Like I said...

04:57.360 --> 04:59.930
Yue, care to dance a song with me?

04:59.930 --> 05:02.280
Gladly.

05:02.280 --> 05:03.330
Wha...

05:03.330 --> 05:07.240
Hey, Nagumo! Don't run away
just because you think it's a pain...

05:07.240 --> 05:09.040
Explain yourself!

05:15.950 --> 05:17.770
Having fun, Yue?

05:17.770 --> 05:18.710
Yeah.

05:21.550 --> 05:24.630
It's definitely my turn next!

05:24.630 --> 05:26.040
That is unfair!

05:26.040 --> 05:27.490
She's right!

05:27.490 --> 05:29.920
Let's decide this fairly
with a rock-scissors-paper!

05:29.920 --> 05:31.390
That's for the best.

05:31.390 --> 05:32.430
Shizuku?

05:32.430 --> 05:33.160
Huh?

05:33.160 --> 05:35.310
I'm not dancing, mind you!

05:49.220 --> 05:50.980
Master Hajime Nagumo.

05:52.330 --> 05:54.850
Care for a dance with me?

05:55.770 --> 05:58.300
You sure you want to
leave the crown prince?

05:58.750 --> 06:02.040
I'm mostly done with the courtesy call.

06:02.040 --> 06:04.800
It's now my time to enjoy the party.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.160
Man...

06:09.370 --> 06:13.310
Anyway, I was hoping
you'd take my hand now.

06:17.010 --> 06:17.990
Yue?

06:18.890 --> 06:21.920
Don't embarrass yourself in public.

06:22.640 --> 06:24.070
Okay.

06:24.650 --> 06:26.960
I'll gladly accompany you, Princess.

06:26.960 --> 06:27.890
Sure.

06:28.580 --> 06:31.580
Rock! Paper! Scissors!

06:33.190 --> 06:35.690
Thank you for earlier.

06:35.690 --> 06:38.090
So you knew it was me?

06:38.090 --> 06:41.330
Your "crimson" was so beautiful...

06:41.760 --> 06:43.840
I couldn't mistake it.

06:43.840 --> 06:47.280
Well, it's only a temporary fix,

06:47.280 --> 06:49.350
since the Empire's head is like that.

06:49.760 --> 06:52.680
Even if that's the case, I'm so happy.

06:52.680 --> 06:56.850
I heard from Kaori that you saved me,

06:56.850 --> 06:59.410
so I started looking up to you a bit.

07:00.730 --> 07:04.330
That's why you snapped
and put on that attitude and gown?

07:04.330 --> 07:06.110
Doesn't it suit me?

07:06.110 --> 07:08.960
I prefer that peach gown instead.

07:08.960 --> 07:11.310
Is it a spiteful remark
to get a black one instead?

07:12.120 --> 07:15.670
So you saw me through that thread?

07:15.670 --> 07:18.130
My shameful look...

07:18.930 --> 07:22.080
I can't get hitched anymore...

07:22.080 --> 07:24.690
You're sticking too close to me.

07:25.200 --> 07:28.150
The crown prince's starting
to have a crazy look on his face.

07:29.530 --> 07:31.410
That's fine.

07:31.410 --> 07:35.610
When this night is over,
I'll become the de facto crown princess.

07:35.610 --> 07:38.400
At least let me be
a maiden just for tonight.

07:39.050 --> 07:42.100
Or you rather not listen
to a princess' trivial wish,

07:42.100 --> 07:46.130
when she's about to be assaulted,
and bullied by her husband's lovers?

07:46.130 --> 07:47.910
Won't you?

07:48.960 --> 07:52.660
So it's already certain
they'll do that to you?

07:52.660 --> 07:54.510
It is.

07:55.740 --> 07:57.230
If...

07:58.320 --> 08:01.660
If I asked you to save me...
what would you do?

08:07.590 --> 08:10.930
Well, eventually, I'd come save you.

08:11.680 --> 08:14.990
The Empire may be over tonight.

08:15.440 --> 08:19.190
At the very least,
that crown prince is just too bad.

08:19.190 --> 08:20.340
Huh?

08:21.740 --> 08:22.740
Also...

08:23.200 --> 08:25.900
If you want me to spoil you,
then make it more obvious.

08:26.310 --> 08:28.530
I'm not really good at taking hints, you see.

08:28.530 --> 08:31.090
I might do something
you don't want me to.

08:33.240 --> 08:37.350
There are people who will be sad
if you're in despair.

08:39.180 --> 08:43.670
You should've said something like,
"It's all for your sake," even if it's a lie.

08:43.670 --> 08:44.410
Well...

08:44.890 --> 08:49.760
Anyway, just think that the worst
won't happen to you.

08:50.650 --> 08:53.760
As long as you're friends with them.

08:53.760 --> 08:56.520
Always a man of his word, aren't you?

08:57.020 --> 08:59.770
I really envy Miss Yue.

09:01.170 --> 09:02.400
Thank you.

09:07.280 --> 09:09.590
What a playboy...

09:09.590 --> 09:12.020
He really goes at the slightest chance...

09:12.020 --> 09:14.890
Hey, what did you whisper to her?

09:14.890 --> 09:17.540
Lily is getting married, you know?

09:17.540 --> 09:20.620
I cannot believe you are finally into NTR...

09:20.620 --> 09:22.730
Abnormal fetishes sure are nice...

09:23.300 --> 09:25.600
She's gone beyond the distant world!

09:25.600 --> 09:28.300
It's beyond my capacity!

09:28.300 --> 09:30.420
Don't worry, I understand.

09:32.330 --> 09:33.740
All units.

09:34.150 --> 09:35.550
This is HQ.

09:36.300 --> 09:38.060
All deployments complete.

09:38.730 --> 09:40.560
Commencing operation now.

09:46.540 --> 09:48.570
Mister Hajime, Miss Yue.

09:49.780 --> 09:53.570
You are now the Haulia tribe
chieftain's daughter.

09:54.400 --> 09:55.420
Go for it.

09:57.510 --> 09:59.220
Yes, I will!

10:05.840 --> 10:07.290
Once again...

10:07.780 --> 10:10.580
I thank you all for attending
the welcome party...

10:10.580 --> 10:15.940
...and official engagement party
of Princess Liliana with my son.

10:17.150 --> 10:19.350
There's a lot of surprises.

10:19.350 --> 10:21.970
This has been an interesting event.

10:24.100 --> 10:26.450
All units, this is Alpha.

10:26.880 --> 10:31.110
From now on, we will put an end
to hundreds of years of persecution,

10:31.110 --> 10:33.330
and make our mark
on the history of this world.

10:33.760 --> 10:36.070
As people synonymous with fear.

10:36.610 --> 10:38.680
This place is a crossroads of destiny.

10:38.680 --> 10:41.120
Will we be doomed to hell,
or progress to the future...

10:41.120 --> 10:44.150
It all depends on this battle.

10:44.150 --> 10:46.690
No need to show mercy at all.

10:46.690 --> 10:50.910
Let's show them what
the so-called weakest lot can do!

10:52.530 --> 10:56.980
Boss, we thank you
for guiding us to this battlefield.

10:56.980 --> 10:58.140
Yeah.

10:58.530 --> 11:00.590
Give them a hell of a show.

11:03.840 --> 11:08.730
Through this marriage,
mankind will become even more united.

11:09.110 --> 11:11.340
We have nothing to fear of.

11:11.340 --> 11:16.290
Glory to mankind!

11:18.240 --> 11:19.280
What?

11:19.280 --> 11:20.030
What happened?

11:20.030 --> 11:20.870
What's happening?

11:20.870 --> 11:21.770
No!

11:21.770 --> 11:23.100
What's going on?!

11:23.100 --> 11:25.480
Don't fear!
Get some light with magic!

11:26.500 --> 11:27.750
Calm down!

11:28.230 --> 11:30.750
You call yourselves Imperials?

11:35.770 --> 11:37.860
Such sneak attack!
How annoying!

11:38.740 --> 11:39.790
Who are...

11:46.980 --> 11:49.920
Damn it, they're so fast.

11:49.920 --> 11:51.690
I can't feel their presence!

11:51.690 --> 11:53.630
This is no time to complain!

11:53.630 --> 11:56.270
You there, focus on getting them in sight!

11:56.270 --> 11:58.200
The rest should focus on defence!

12:00.160 --> 12:01.160
Light them all.

12:01.160 --> 12:02.470
Lantern.

12:08.550 --> 12:10.740
Don't let them have their way!

12:10.740 --> 12:12.000
Begin counterattack!

12:15.130 --> 12:17.090
Blow it all away, Wind Wall!

12:19.300 --> 12:21.300
Break through them, Fire Bullet!

12:32.710 --> 12:35.430
So this is the Emperor's strength...

12:35.430 --> 12:38.030
Just perfect! I'll cut him into slices!

12:40.030 --> 12:42.110
Quite the pleasant
murderous intent you have...

12:42.110 --> 12:42.950
Haulia!

12:43.390 --> 12:46.530
Huh? Too scared,
you can't even scream?

12:47.160 --> 12:50.870
Words are tactless on the battlefield.
Try to cut through me!

12:51.330 --> 12:52.330
You asked for it!

12:52.720 --> 12:57.540
No way a rabbitman can be that strong...

13:00.270 --> 13:02.910
Commander, where's the other troops?

13:02.910 --> 13:04.890
Why are there only us?

13:04.890 --> 13:07.640
Anyway, we must get to
His Majesty now.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.150
That's an imperial command!

13:11.770 --> 13:12.900
My...

13:12.900 --> 13:15.380
What good fortune!

13:15.380 --> 13:17.780
I didn't think I'd run into you...

13:17.780 --> 13:19.130
You...

13:19.130 --> 13:23.030
Right now, my tribesmen
are attacking your emperor.

13:23.440 --> 13:26.790
If you want to save him,
you have to defeat me first.

13:26.790 --> 13:27.570
What?

13:27.570 --> 13:31.850
Commander, just ignore that rabbitman!

13:37.810 --> 13:39.790
You have to defeat me first...

13:40.150 --> 13:41.430
That's what I said.

13:42.090 --> 13:46.430
If you and your soldiers want to fight me,
then allow me to introduce myself.

13:46.800 --> 13:48.130
I am Shea.

13:49.860 --> 13:54.220
Shea Haulia. I was once attacked
by you and your men...

13:54.220 --> 13:55.630
I am that monster.

13:58.940 --> 14:00.630
Monster?

14:00.630 --> 14:02.860
How dare you look down on us, rabbitman!

14:02.860 --> 14:06.630
Everyone, kill that rabbitman
and proceed forward!

14:06.630 --> 14:09.760
Even if she's strong,
she's still a beastman!

14:09.760 --> 14:11.000
Stop her with magic!

14:13.550 --> 14:15.670
I'll ribby-rabby you up...

14:16.240 --> 14:17.220
Yes!

14:21.570 --> 14:23.720
Spread out! Loose formation!

14:28.850 --> 14:31.810
Fool. How could you
throw your own weapon...

14:41.740 --> 14:43.700
How impudent!

14:46.150 --> 14:49.160
This can't be happening!

15:08.250 --> 15:10.740
Please spare me...

15:15.660 --> 15:17.560
See you on the moon...

15:17.920 --> 15:19.340
Yes!

15:19.340 --> 15:20.490
No...

15:34.650 --> 15:39.180
Have I finally avenged you all?

15:56.260 --> 15:57.150
What?

15:57.530 --> 15:58.440
My body...

15:59.040 --> 16:01.900
We've sprayed
a paralytic poison for monsters.

16:03.060 --> 16:04.110
Curses...

16:25.600 --> 16:27.090
Here's the antidote.

16:27.090 --> 16:28.330
Curse you...

16:35.520 --> 16:38.270
Wh-What's going on?!

16:38.270 --> 16:41.230
Just calm down, Princess.

16:41.230 --> 16:43.730
We're reaching the climax now.

16:47.940 --> 16:50.720
Now, Gahard D. Hoelscher.

16:50.720 --> 16:53.780
You know why I spared you, right?

16:55.360 --> 16:57.460
You must have a wish.

16:57.460 --> 16:59.730
Speak. I'll listen.

16:59.730 --> 17:03.440
You're losing points.
You better know your place now.

17:08.620 --> 17:10.050
You little...

17:10.770 --> 17:14.030
Understand what it means
to underestimate the land.

17:17.470 --> 17:21.030
The lives of the people in here...

17:21.030 --> 17:23.060
...depend on your actions and words.

17:24.210 --> 17:26.550
That's the Necklace of Vows.

17:27.580 --> 17:32.570
An artifact that makes you abide
by the oath you have uttered with your life.

17:32.990 --> 17:38.210
Anyone whose soul is linked
to yours must wear it for life or die.

17:38.210 --> 17:40.830
Should you break your oath,
you'll also die.

17:40.830 --> 17:43.080
Oath?

17:43.440 --> 17:44.950
We have four demands.

17:45.340 --> 17:47.980
One, release the beastmen.

17:47.980 --> 17:52.010
Two, commit to the non-aggression,
non-interference pact in the Sea of Trees.

17:52.340 --> 17:56.740
Three, ban the slavery
and persecution of beastmen.

17:56.740 --> 17:59.850
Four, legalise and comply with the law.

18:00.810 --> 18:02.010
Do you understand?

18:02.480 --> 18:06.350
If you do, make an oath
in the name of Hoelscher.

18:06.350 --> 18:08.180
Then it will activate.

18:08.180 --> 18:09.860
And if I don't comply?

18:09.860 --> 18:12.210
More officers' heads will start flying,

18:12.210 --> 18:15.580
and the muddy assassination
stage will go on forever.

18:15.580 --> 18:17.630
You're asking for war, then.

18:17.630 --> 18:20.940
I won't say any vow!

18:20.940 --> 18:23.980
I see. Another point lost, Gahard.

18:24.880 --> 18:29.130
Let go! Who do you think I am?!

18:29.130 --> 18:32.130
You filthy beasts!

18:32.580 --> 18:36.390
I'll kill you all!
I'll have all your heads!

18:36.390 --> 18:38.890
I'll kill you! Prepare yourselves...

18:42.140 --> 18:46.960
I told you, even if you massacre them,
I won't budge.

18:46.960 --> 18:50.150
You will be put to the ground
by the furious Empire.

18:50.150 --> 18:52.420
I see, what a shame.

18:52.420 --> 18:54.810
Delta, this is Alpha.

18:54.810 --> 18:55.660
Do it.

18:57.660 --> 18:59.540
What was that?

18:59.540 --> 19:01.410
Oh, it's nothing big.

19:02.290 --> 19:05.170
We just blew up the slave guard barracks.

19:05.540 --> 19:06.500
What?

19:07.270 --> 19:10.810
At the very least,
I count hundreds of soldiers dead.

19:11.170 --> 19:13.300
It's all your fault.

19:13.700 --> 19:15.930
You did that, you beast!

19:15.930 --> 19:19.630
No, you killed them, Gahard.

19:19.630 --> 19:22.710
Your decision cost the lives of your soldiers.

19:23.090 --> 19:25.190
Delta, this is Alpha.

19:25.190 --> 19:26.220
Do it.

19:26.220 --> 19:27.700
Hey, Haulia!

19:29.630 --> 19:31.440
What did you blow up now?

19:31.440 --> 19:34.420
Don't worry.
It's just a military installation.

19:34.420 --> 19:36.470
It only killed soldiers.

19:36.470 --> 19:39.200
Or do you have a request?

19:40.830 --> 19:43.310
So, no request?

19:43.910 --> 19:45.330
Delta, do it.

19:45.330 --> 19:46.080
Wait!

19:49.100 --> 19:52.400
If you don't want to make a vow,
then so be it.

19:52.960 --> 19:54.590
We'll blow the Empire to kingdom come,

19:54.590 --> 19:57.210
and make it a tribute to you all.

19:57.210 --> 19:59.140
Delta, this is Alpha...

19:59.140 --> 20:00.280
Wait!

20:08.770 --> 20:09.920
You bastard!

20:10.330 --> 20:11.460
Damn it!

20:12.160 --> 20:13.360
I concede!

20:14.130 --> 20:15.360
I'll follow your request!

20:16.070 --> 20:17.110
So please...

20:18.000 --> 20:20.870
No more indiscriminate bombing!

20:21.840 --> 20:23.920
Splendid.

20:23.920 --> 20:25.870
Go on, say your vow.

20:29.280 --> 20:30.290
Sorry!

20:30.770 --> 20:33.980
I'm really done for this time.

20:35.590 --> 20:38.340
Strength reigns supreme in the Empire.

20:38.340 --> 20:42.640
These rabbitmen have shown
that by taking down this castle.

20:43.060 --> 20:44.130
Therefore...

20:45.230 --> 20:47.620
On behalf of Hoelscher Empire...

20:48.740 --> 20:50.400
I shall swear on this!

20:52.580 --> 20:53.740
Mister Hajime.

20:55.210 --> 20:56.100
Shea.

20:57.430 --> 20:59.400
It's all done.

21:00.080 --> 21:02.180
I see. Well done.

21:03.170 --> 21:04.940
Boss, this is Alpha.

21:06.350 --> 21:07.640
I'm retreating.

21:07.640 --> 21:10.920
We have no words to express our
gratitude for your countless assistance.

21:11.260 --> 21:13.920
It's for Shea's sake.
Don't mention it.

21:14.550 --> 21:17.670
But it's still not over yet.

21:18.130 --> 21:21.390
In fact, this is where the real battle begins.

21:21.390 --> 21:23.430
I understand, Boss.

21:23.780 --> 21:26.540
I was planning on fighting from the start.

21:27.700 --> 21:32.440
The new Haulia tribe has decided
to walk on this path, after all.

21:33.130 --> 21:34.470
I guess so...

21:34.470 --> 21:37.270
You've shown me enough
of your determination.

21:38.070 --> 21:39.890
Calling all Haulias...

21:43.290 --> 21:44.630
You've done well.

23:32.970 --> 23:34.930
THE HERO RETURNS

23:34.930 --> 23:37.610
THE HERO RETURNS
Next episode: The Hero Returns.

23:37.610 --> 23:40.610
THE HERO RETURNS
